---
description: Android security — no secrets in source or logs; secure storage for credentials.
alwaysApply: false
globs:
  - "**/AndroidManifest.xml"
  - "**/network/**/*.kt"
  - "**/*Api.kt"
  - "**/security/**/*.kt"
---

# Security

- No secrets in source, logs, or `BuildConfig`.
- Use Keystore-backed storage for on-device secrets; do not treat DataStore or SharedPreferences as encrypted by default.
- Validate inputs; request minimum permissions; review exported components and `PendingIntent` flags in review.
